    "cause": "SIGSTOP teardown variant did not observe the real interrupt-stop/queued-hardware-trap race before the five-second setup budget expired. The hook therefore never sent application SIGSTOP, causing the second assertion to fail. Earlier native regression failure skipped frontend smoke, so screenshot upload failed for missing files.",
